105
00:29:15,079 --> 00:29:17,079
So...

106
00:29:21,619 --> 00:29:30,240
If you think about this, each of these pairs can be represented by a new symbol.

107
00:29:34,079 --> 00:29:39,240
So this can be assumed as standard Turing machine.

108
00:29:40,919 --> 00:29:43,099
Burayı Türkçe de söyleyelim.

