00:33:47,256 --> 00:33:55,975
Well, when the head tries to move left from the border, so this is the border,

135
00:33:58,324 --> 00:34:01,544
It turns back to the leftmost position.

136
00:34:01,703 --> 00:34:09,043
So in a way, it wants to go to left, but it cannot go to left, and it stays there.

137
00:34:10,564 --> 00:34:15,184
So this is semi-infinite tape Turing machine.

138
00:34:15,184 --> 00:34:18,963
Semi-infinite tape Turing machine.

139
